The news is out and the numbers are huge, for another set of record-breaking quarterly results! Here’s what made the last 3 months so great: 

- Record quarterly transaction volume and revenue, annualising at $10.4b and $669.6m respectively;
- We now have 9.9m customers, who used Zip a record 22.4m times;
- We have 81.8k merchants, including our newest members of the ZipFam Foot Locker, Mercari US, REVOLVE, SHEIN, Virgin Australia and many more;

We also completed our acquisitions of Spotii, A ZipPay Company and Twisto, A Zip Company, giving us regional HQs and passports for fearless expansion into the Middle East and Europe.

Thanks to everyone involved in making this happen - our customers for all the love, merchant partners for working with us to create the best solutions, our investors for their ongoing support and of course our Zipsters for their tireless efforts!

We’ve built great momentum to blow it out of the park in 2022 - and we’re just getting started.

Check out the full update here: https://lnkd.in/gEjy_5tg

#wearezip #strongertogether #changethegame
